      m_Calls: []
  m_text: " HOW TO PLAY\r\n\r\n CONTROLS\r\n\r\n- Arrow Keys:** Move Up, Down, Left
    and Right.\r\n- W, A, S, D:** Alternative keyboard controls.\r\n- Gamepad D-Pad
    / Left Stick:** Move the snake.\r\n\r\nFOOD TYPES\r\n\r\nNORMAL FOOD\r\n- Increases
    snake length by 1 segment.\r\n- Gives 10 points.\r\n\r\nBONUS FOOD\r\n- Gives
    50 extra points.\r\n- Disappears after 5 seconds if not collected.\r\n\r\nSHRINK
    FOOD\r\n- Removes 2 segments from the snake.\r\n- Minimum snake length is 3."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
